OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new national park may be
OL,4,Ascrapped this week, campaigners say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group says it fears plans to
OL,7,Fcreate the first national park in Wales
OL,8,Fsince 1957 will be scrapped by the
OL,9,FWelsh government this week.
OL,11,FAn announcement is due about the next
OL,12,Fsteps for the proposed Glyndwr National
OL,13,FPark, covering the Clwydian Range and
OL,14,FDee Valley in north-east Wales.
OL,16,FThe previous Welsh government under
OL,17,FLabour said in March it would hold a
OL,18,Fpublic inquiry into creating the park
OL,19,Fafter councils raised concerns about
OL,20,Ffunding and planning rules within it.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
