OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new national park may be
OL,4,Ascrapped this week, campaigners say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government, now led by Plaid
OL,7,FCymru, said Constitution Minister
OL,8,FDafydd Trystan Davies would make a
OL,9,Fstatement on the matter on Tuesday.
